"Hockey Planner is our small contribution to a much bigger tradition. It "
"is a way of giving back to the community and supporting the people who "
"make hockey possible, one practice at a time."
msgstr ""
"Hockey Planner, c’est notre façon de redonner un peu au hockey d’ici. On "
"veut donner un coup de main aux gens qui font vivre le hockey dans nos "
"arénas, une pratique à la fois."

